Source: php-pinba
Section: php
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Oleg Ekhlakov <o.ekhlakov@protonmail.com>
Build-Depends:
 debhelper-compat (= 13),
 php8.2-dev,
 php8.3-dev,
 php8.4-dev,
 php8.5-dev,
 libprotobuf-c-dev,
 pkgconf
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Homepage: https://github.com/XOlegator/pinba_extension
Vcs-Git: https://github.com/XOlegator/pinba_extension.git
Vcs-Browser: https://github.com/XOlegator/pinba_extension
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: php8.2-pinba
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, ${php:Depends}, php8.2-common
Provides: php-pinba
Description: Pinba timer/profiling extension for PHP 8.2
 Pinba measures PHP script execution and sends compact Protocol Buffers
 statistics over UDP to a Pinba server — the pinba_engine storage engine for
 MySQL or MariaDB — enabling real-time monitoring of request time, memory usage
 and user-defined timers.
 .
 This package provides the extension built for PHP 8.2.

